cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use weedscout, please cite it as below."
title: "weedscout: within-field scouting maps from Sentinel-2"
abstract: >-
  weedscout turns free Sentinel-2 imagery and a field-boundary file into a map of the zones that
  persistently underperformed the rest of their own crop, as a prioritised list of places to scout.
  It is a scouting map, not a weed detector.
type: software
version: 1.6.0
date-released: "2026-10-14"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/field-intelligence-platform/Precision-Weed-Detection-and-Targeted-Spraying"
authors:
  - given-names: Gowtham
    family-names: Uppalapati
keywords:
  - Sentinel-2
  - precision agriculture
  - remote sensing
  - field scouting
  - NDVI
